* Board 4, circuit 7: voltage controlled amplifier (Fig. 9-11), as drawn.
* in: filter output; cont: loudness contour (pin 9); loud: EXT. LOUDNESS (pin 10);
* a440: the A-440 oscillator's output (Q4's emitter); out: Q17's collector, ahead of C2.
* t1, t2: 1ST and 2ND VCA BAL positions (0..1).
.subckt vca in cont loud a440 out vp vn params: t1=0.5 t2=0.5 r40=2.2k
* supply ladder and the pairs' base bias (node d)
r10 vp p1 120
r11 p1 p2 150
r13 p2 p3 120
r22 p3 d 120
r36 d 0 510
c15 d 0 220u
c4 vp p1 220u
* first VCA: Q16 / Q15, tail Q18
r2 in ci 82k
c6 ci b16 0.33u
r34 b16 d 820
q16 c16 b16 e1 TIS97
q15 c15 d e1 TIS97
r19 c16 l1a 100
r23 c15 l1b 100
r14a l1a p3 {25*t1+1m}
r14b l1b p3 {25*(1-t1)+1m}
r35 e1 c18 1k
q18 c18 b18 e18 TIS97
r59 cont b18 68k
r37 e18 0 6.8k
r43 e18 vn 270k
* second VCA: Q14 / Q13 on the first pair's collectors, tail Q21
q14 c14 c16 e2 TIS97
q13 c13 c15 e2 TIS97
r18 c14 l2a 330
r21 c13 l2b 330
r12a l2a p2 {100*t2+1m}
r12b l2b p2 {100*(1-t2)+1m}
r33 e2 c21 470
q21 c21 b21 e21 TIS97
r51 loud b21 33k
r42 e21 0 3.3k
r44 e21 vn 150k
* output: Q12 / Q17 on the second pair's collectors, current source Q1
q1 e3 p1 e1s Q2N4058
r9 vp e1s 62
r8 e12 e3 8.2
r28 e17 e3 8.2
q12 c12 c14 e12 Q2N4058
q17 out c13 e17 Q2N4058
r30 c12 0 680
r29 out 0 680
d2 0 out D1N458A
d1 out vp D1N458A
* A-440 into Q14's collector (Q12's base): R40 reads 2.2K on Fig. 9-11 and in Table 7-8 (1K, then
* 10K with the 94-002 kit, in Folkman's modifications)
r40 a440 a4 {r40}
c8 a4 c14 0.1u
.ends
